msgstr ":mf-chip:`buildings|建筑物` :mf-badge:`+ 建筑类型`"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:27 0b4e38a33b424a578a0926b0a80fa814
msgid ""
"Example: 10 km² on Mapbox zoom 18 ≈ 130 credits. Your own imagery costs "
"nothing."
msgstr "示例：Mapbox 缩放级别 18 下 10 km² ≈ 130 积分。使用您自己的影像不收费。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:27 82cf7d2806484ffab0879f991de0c0e0
msgid ""
"Runs the Buildings model with classification switched on, so each roof "
"polygon gets a building class. Classification adds no extra cost."
msgstr "在开启分类的情况下运行建筑物模型，每个屋顶多边形都会获得建筑类别。分类不额外收费。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:27 6e4a4ca83bdc4061b4791cc339d28f43
msgid "Building polygons with a class attribute."
msgstr "带类别属性的建筑物多边形。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:27 d2711a1c37634c0c8600f7a2102113af
msgid "Compare residential and non-residential stock by district"
msgstr "按区比较住宅与非住宅建筑存量"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:27 30e68d23d7284276becb45db8f5a84fb
msgid "Pull industrial and commercial sites into their own layer"
msgstr "将工业和商业用地提取到单独图层"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:27 e157e08d55aa425aba565c568d732d43
msgid "Feed zoning and land-use analysis with fresh data"
msgstr "为分区规划和土地利用分析提供最新数据"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:28 3ea4e4e49e85440784c8ba217e1e247d
msgid ""
"The full list of types is in the :ref:`building classes reference "
"<buildings_classes>`."
msgstr "完整类型列表见 :ref:`建筑类别参考 <buildings_classes>`。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:36 85968fb5730b4260a61460fa4a39bd71
msgid ":mf-chip:`buildings|Buildings` :mf-badge:`+ Heights (beta)`"
msgstr ":mf-chip:`buildings|建筑物` :mf-badge:`+ 高度（测试版）`"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:36 73e69e3b0a4a4fd2af0606fdde866b55
msgid "20 credits per km² + imagery"
msgstr "每 km² 20 积分 + 影像"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:36 448dec42183e420fa666ff684a807803
msgid ""
"Example: 10 km² on Mapbox zoom 19 ≈ 290 credits. Your own imagery costs "
"nothing."
msgstr "示例：Mapbox 缩放级别 19 下 10 km² ≈ 290 积分。使用您自己的影像不收费。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:36 956fa65da444493f98ae84ae33fb6fb7
msgid ""
"Adds a height model that reads shadow length and visible walls. The result "
"is a 3D footprint: the building contour projected to ground level instead of"
" the roof outline."
msgstr "增加一个高度模型，通过阴影长度和可见墙面进行估算。结果是三维底面轮廓：建筑轮廓投影到地面，而不是屋顶轮廓。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:36 0a3970a62d244785b23d1a55addf91f4
msgid ""
"Footprint polygons with a height attribute, ready for the QGIS 3D map view."
msgstr "带高度属性的底面轮廓多边形，可直接用于 QGIS 三维地图视图。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:36 d9fdd4e000814a40a6cfd1520477cb8f
msgid ""
"0.3 m imagery (zoom 19) with visible shadows. Helps most on oblique imagery,"
" where roofs look shifted."
msgstr "带可见阴影的 0.3 米影像（缩放级别 19）。在屋顶看起来发生偏移的倾斜影像上效果最明显。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:36 1d22a930bb85437abc936d1fb12790a0
msgid "Extrude buildings in the QGIS 3D map view"
msgstr "在 QGIS 三维地图视图中拉伸建筑物"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:36 be50933505fd41c2a9cd36ff049982ce
msgid "Estimate floor area and building volume"
msgstr "估算建筑面积和建筑体积"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:36 4e2e40c1e26741ef810de74d26761158
msgid "Screen areas for shade and line-of-sight studies"
msgstr "为日照阴影和视线分析筛查区域"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:37 45029b362cfe406480a144a39136a427
msgid ""
"The model does not see footprints directly, because walls hide them in the "
"image. Like a cartographer, it moves the roof outline down to the bottom of "
"the wall."
msgstr "模型无法直接看到建筑底面，因为影像中墙体会遮挡底面。它会像制图员一样，把屋顶轮廓下移到墙脚。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:41 30dc7ca849ff4ab6975b79c1d8f1cf70
msgid "All options"
msgstr "所有选项"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:46 0e9efb1a1615416fb8b534e24734e6da
msgid "Building types"
msgstr "建筑类型"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:46 3ea4e4e49e85440784c8ba217e1e247d
msgid ""
"Assigns every building one of the main classes (see :ref:`reference "
"<buildings_classes>`). No extra cost."
msgstr "为每栋建筑分配一个主要类别（参见 :ref:`参考 <buildings_classes>`）。不额外收费。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:51 6bd5705f0b294b2ab7adf35cfd835246
msgid "Regularization"
msgstr "规则化"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:49 48355fbfb1ff4b808c87039f4a0beca4
msgid ""
"Corrects irregular contours. Shapes are replaced with rectangles, circles or"
" polygons with 90° angles that fit the original shape. The result is more "
"map-friendly, but some of the original mask accuracy can be lost."
msgstr "修正不规则轮廓。形状会被替换为贴合原始形状的矩形、圆形或直角多边形。结果更适合制图，但可能损失部分原始掩膜精度。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:55 30dc7ca849ff4ab6975b79c1d8f1cf70
msgid "Simplification"
msgstr "简化"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:54 7efb953cd14846d3970b8329d6cbb717
msgid ""
"Simplifies the building shape while staying close to the original mask, "
"including curved and complex shapes. Fewer right angles than regularization."
msgstr "在贴近原始掩膜的前提下简化建筑形状，适用于曲线和复杂形状。直角少于规则化。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:60 77e5155b02ae48a0a8bc356b95fb6b95
msgid "Merge with OpenStreetMap"
msgstr "与 OpenStreetMap 合并"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:58 a092eb556965423683af0a132c3d8f55
msgid ""
"Where OpenStreetMap coverage is good, each building that has a matching OSM "
"object (Jaccard index) is replaced with the OSM polygon, and rotated to "
"align with the nearest OSM road. The result is then no longer based on the "
"image, so buildings can be shifted from their actual position."
msgstr ""
"在 OpenStreetMap 覆盖良好的区域，凡是有匹配 OSM 对象（按 Jaccard 指数）的建筑，都会被替换为 OSM "
"多边形，并旋转以对齐最近的 OSM 道路。此时结果不再基于影像，建筑可能偏离实际位置。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:65 c3ff27ed906e4af58a245050f3c988d6
msgid "Height estimation (beta)"
msgstr "高度估算（测试版）"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:63 956fa65da444493f98ae84ae33fb6fb7
msgid ""
"A regression model estimates height from visual cues such as shadow length "
"and visible walls, and returns 3D footprints: the contour projected to "
"ground level instead of the roof outline. Most useful on oblique imagery, "
"where roofs appear shifted. +10 credits per km²."
msgstr ""
"回归模型根据阴影长度和可见墙面等视觉线索估算高度，并返回三维底面轮廓：投影到地面的轮廓，而不是屋顶轮廓。在屋顶看起来发生偏移的倾斜影像上最有用。每 "
"km² 另加 10 积分。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:68 7512bea9e93d4c9486dc994c6a6c1d7e
msgid ""
"Buildings smaller than 20 m² are removed from the result to avoid clutter."
msgstr "小于 20 m² 的建筑会从结果中移除，以免图面杂乱。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:73 71ec1e517e5d48efbdfedddfbc9b0072
msgid "Benchmarks"
msgstr "基准测试"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:75 cd672bb2c4384e1e8274c9066f247591
msgid ""
"**Buildings v.2026-07-06** (Global, segmentation, 0.3 m / z19) was evaluated"
" against manually annotated ground truth. Metrics are area-based: IoU is the"
" intersection-over-union of the predicted and ground-truth building masks, "
"and F1, precision and recall are computed on the overlapping mask area."
msgstr ""
"**Buildings v.2026-07-06**\\ （全球，分割，0.3 米 / z19）基于人工标注的真值进行评估。指标按面积计算：IoU "
"为预测建筑掩膜与真值掩膜的交并比，F1、精确率和召回率按掩膜重叠面积计算。"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst dc5de10ac5894ddf93dbc598b4a665a9
msgid "Aerial imagery"
msgstr "航拍图像"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:87 ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:162
#: 30dc7ca849ff4ab6975b79c1d8f1cf70
msgid "AOI (location)"
msgstr "AOI（位置）"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:88 ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:163
#: e30e1bb09c9543a99147fc921cd3dd13
msgid "Predicted features"
msgstr "预测特征"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:89 ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:164
#: 9a39b0168bcf471896d5db5fc267afee
msgid "IoU"
msgstr "IOU"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:90 ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:165
#: 15beed923a35477ea08611fb879bfeee
msgid "F1"
msgstr "F1"

#: ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:91 ../userguides/buildings_model.rst:166
#: 49f1b3ee9413415cad5a791bfb1201bc
msgid "Precision"
